         MACRO                                          
         DEVSECT ,                                      
         PUSH  PRINT                                    
         AIF   ('&SYSPARM' NE 'SUP').WED01              
         PRINT OFF,NOGEN  
.WED01   ANOP  ,          
* *************************************************************
* *
* *      User Interrupt Table Entry (by HNDINT or HNDIO)
* *      First 16 bytes also maps entries in DEVTAB
* *
* *************************************************************
DEVSECT  DSECT ,              *** User Interrupt Table Entry ***     
DEVADDR  DS    1H                 Virtual device address
DEVTYPE  DS    0XL2               Device type (in DEVTAB)
DEVFLAG  DS    1X                 Device flags
DEVPSDOW EQU   X'80'              X....... Pseudo wait bit (from WAITD)
DEVASAP  EQU   X'40'              .X...... HNDINT/HNDIO issued w/ ASAP 
DEVINTR  EQU   X'20'              ..X..... Interrupt received
DEVINTP  EQU   X'10'              ...X.... Interrupt processed
DEVKEEP  EQU   X'08'              ....X... KEEP past end-of-command
DEVABNKP EQU   X'04'              .....X.. Keep beyond ABEND processing
DEVPERST EQU   X'02'              ......X. Keep beyond DET/DEF 
DEVHNDIO EQU   X'01'              .......X Created via HNDIO
         DS    XL1                (not used)
DEVNAME  DS    CL4                Symbolic device name
DEVSLIH  DS    1A                 Interrupt handler address
DEVMISC  DS    XL4                Use varies by device type
*                             End of DEVTAB entries
         ORG   DEVMISC        User Interrupt Table has more
DEVIOPSW DS    2F                 I/O Old PSW
DEVCSW   DS    2F                 CSW
DEVUWORD DS    1F                 UWORD from HNDIO
DEVSIZE  EQU   *-DEVSECT      Interrupt Table Entry size (in bytes)
         EJECT ,
         POP   PRINT
         MEND 